# llm-3b and llm-8b are deliberately NOT claimed on iOS. The pipeline holds the
# weights, the prefill logits and two KV sets resident at once, and iOS kills
# the app (EXC_RESOURCE) past a per-process limit measured at 3376 MB on an
# 8 GB device:
#
#   llm-3b: 3.05 GiB weights + 1.31 GiB KV = 4.36 GiB before a single logit.
#   llm-8b: 7.55 GiB weights + 1.50 GiB KV = 9.05 GiB, more than the device has.
#
# Shrinking the prefill bucket cannot recover either one, so claiming them would
# only offer the user a benchmark that kills the app. claim_policy is
# CLAIM_SHARED, so the TFLite fallback still offers these benchmarks. Android
# keeps all six sizes; it has far more headroom.
